{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18658","headline":"构法华寺西亭 · 柳宗元","name":"构法华寺西亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窜身楚南极，山水穷险艰。\n步登最高寺，萧散任疎顽。\n西垂下斗绝，欲似窥人寰。\n反如在幽谷，榛翳不可攀。\n命童恣披翦，葺宇横断山。\n割如判清浊，飘若升云间。\n远岫攒衆顶，澄江抱清湾。\n夕照临轩堕，栖鸟当我还。\n菡萏溢嘉色，篔簹遗清斑。\n神舒屏羁锁，志适忘幽孱。\n弃逐久枯槁，迨今始开颜。\n赏心难久留，离念来相关。\n北望间亲爱，南瞻杂夷蛮。\n置之勿复道，且寄须臾闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}